      "writtenOn": "2023-09-22T16:48:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have uses for CBOR that don\u0027t need open_dice, and currently open_dice doesn\u0027t have any Ciborium dependency (I think - at least in the interface). So I\u0027d be reluctant to couple them.\n\nBut having multiple pretty-much identical copies of code always pains me, hence the library suggestion.",
